.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH songrec-fingerprint-to-recognized-song 1  "fingerprint-to-recognized-song " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
songrec\-fingerprint\-to\-recognized\-song \- Take a data\-URI Shazam fingerprint, perform song recognition towards Shazam\*(Aqs servers and print obtained information to the standard output.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsongrec fingerprint\-to\-recognized\-song\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIfingerprint\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Take a data\-URI Shazam fingerprint, perform song recognition towards Shazam\*(Aqs servers and print obtained information to the standard output.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIfingerprint\fR>
The data\-URI Shazam fingerprint to recognize.
